{"version":1,"content":"<p>「第30屆ifva獨立短片及影像媒體比賽」昨日（25日）舉行頒獎典禮，講述「子彈仔」單車文化的紀錄片《風馳電掣》被取消入圍資格。</p><p>ifva今日（26日）回覆本報查詢稱，由於《風》未能符合相關參賽要求，故未能參與角逐本屆比賽獎項。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:29.239957+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:57:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:15.942145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:05.450337+00:00","content_hash":"3f283824bed7691733c4b68198d258d19302dccc7e5b9f4deec42d41b319c49a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}